WEBVTT

00:06:58.653 --> 00:07:00.574
is that Vibrio fischeri has a protein.

00:07:00.598 --> 00:07:01.787
That's the red box --

00:07:01.811 --> 00:07:04.785
it's an enzyme that makes
that little hormone molecule,

00:07:04.809 --> 00:07:05.976
the red triangle.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.310
And then as the cells grow,

00:07:07.334 --> 00:07:10.040
they're all releasing that molecule
into the environment,

00:07:10.064 --> 00:07:11.726
so there's lots of molecule there.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.631
And the bacteria also have
a receptor on their cell surface

00:07:15.655 --> 00:07:18.184
that fits like a lock and key
with that molecule.

00:07:18.208 --> 00:07:21.798
These are just like the receptors
on the surfaces of your cells.

00:07:21.822 --> 00:07:24.245
So when the molecule increases
to a certain amount,

00:07:24.269 --> 00:07:26.516
which says something
about the number of cells,

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:28.289
it locks down into that receptor

00:07:28.313 --> 00:07:30.690
and information comes into the cells